BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-04-12-zine-folding-party@lzr.life
DTSTAMP:20260504T024144Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T180000
SUMMARY:Zine Folding Party!
LOCATION:Third Eye Books Zen Garden — 2518 SE 33rd Ave. Portland OR
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Indie Bookstore Day with us!\n\nStop by anytime to hang out\, fold some zines\, read some zines\, and take some zines to distribute!\n\nFeel free to print and bring your favorite zines from our zine catalog at LZR.LIFE (https://lzr.life/)!\n\nSat April 25th\n\n10 am - 6 pm\n\nThird Eye Books Zen Garden\n\n2518 SE 33rd Ave Portland OR\n\nAssemble anti-colonial zines\n\nPick up ICE-alert whistles\n\nNo experience necessary
END:VEVENT
